# verifiedthai.com — environment variables
#
# ─── Dashboard (server-side, Vercel-only) ────────────────────────────────────
# DB (Neon — Vercel Storage → Create Database; auto-injects as DATABASE_URL)
DATABASE_URL=

# NextAuth — `openssl rand -base64 32` then paste here
AUTH_SECRET=

# Resend (magic-link email). https://resend.com/api-keys
# Verify the domain verifiedthai.com first, then create an API key.
AUTH_RESEND_KEY=
AUTH_EMAIL_FROM="Verified Thai <no-reply@verifiedthai.com>"

# Vercel sets NEXTAUTH_URL automatically. Set manually only for local dev:
# NEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ─── Affiliate IDs (build-time) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# DEPRECATED 2026-07: the site dropped the affiliate-booking model in favor
# of traffic + display ads only (Klook/StickyBookBar/affiliate CTAs removed
# from the app — see components/AdSlot.tsx instead). These vars are unused
# by the Next.js app now; only the separate scraper pipeline may still read
# them. Left here for that pipeline's reference, not for new setup.
#
# Sign up at each program, paste your IDs here, then re-run `npm run data`.
# All affiliate URLs are search URLs — affiliate cookie attribution kicks in
# on their search page after the visitor clicks.

# Klook — biggest activities platform in Asia, strongest in Thailand
# Sign up: https://affiliate.klook.com/  (instant approval)
# After approval: dashboard → Account → Affiliate ID
KLOOK_AID=

# Viator (a TripAdvisor company) — global tours/activities
# Sign up: https://www.viator.com/affiliate.jspa  (manual review, ~3 days)
# After approval: Account → API Settings → Partner ID
VIATOR_AID=

# GetYourGuide — strong in Europe + Asia
# Sign up: https://partner.getyourguide.com/  (manual review, ~5 days)
# Partner Hub → Tracking → Partner ID
GYG_AID=

# Agoda — accommodation (wellness retreats, spa hotels, coworking-with-stay)
# Sign up: https://partners.agoda.com/  (instant approval after profile)
# Account → Sub Affiliate ID (CID)
AGODA_AID=

# Trip.com / Booking.com (via Trip.com group)
# Sign up: https://us.trip.com/partners/affiliate/
TRIP_AID=

# Bookimed — medical tourism (wellness, derma, hair, plastic surgery)
# Sign up: https://partners.bookimed.com/  (approval ~1 day)
# Specifically for: wellness, spa (medical-grade)
BOOKIMED_AID=

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional analytics (paste IDs to activate)

# Google Analytics 4 — note the var name is NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID (not _GA4_),
# matching what app/layout.tsx actually reads.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# Plausible (privacy-friendly alternative)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_PLAUSIBLE_DOMAIN=verifiedthai.com

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Display ads (the site's only revenue model — see components/AdSlot.tsx)

# Google AdSense publisher ID. Unset = no ad script loads, AdSlot renders
# nothing. Set once the site has an approved AdSense account, and update
# public/ads.txt with the same publisher ID.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ADSENSE_CLIENT_ID=ca-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Once IDs are in place, re-generate deeplinks for all 7 masters:
#
#   py C:\dbd-scraper\_run_enrichment_all.py
#
# Then refresh the site data:
#
#   cd siamverified-portable  # (local repo folder)
#   npm run data
#   npm run build
#
# Existing places.json keeps PLACEHOLDER_* in the affiliate URLs until you
# do this. PLACEHOLDER doesn't break the links — visitors still land on Klook,
# they just don't carry your tracking. So no rush to fill these.
